The display driver

src/tft_config.py imports a module called st7789, which is not in this
repository. It is a C module compiled into the MicroPython firmware, and it is
MIT licensed.

    Modifications and additions Copyright (c) 2020, 2021 Russ Hughes
    Copyright (c) 2019 Ivan Belokobylskiy
    https://github.com/russhughes/st7789_mpy

The prebuilt firmware images in that repository are the ones this project
expects to be running on; see docs/flashing.md.

---

src/vga1_8x8.py

The classic 8 x 8 VGA text font, carried in the module layout used by
st7789_mpy so that the firmware needs no extra download. The glyph table is the
IBM PC text font, which has been reproduced in public sources for decades; the
module layout around it follows st7789_mpy, above.

